{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act51side_level_act51side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act51side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act51side_level_act51side_05_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PA-6","storyName":"各自流亡","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"阴差阳错之下，皇帝费奥多尔和学生们一起被关进了卡托加区。他借由通讯认识了同在卡托加区的伯塔尼，在他的鼓励下，伯塔尼鼓起勇气挟持了一个关键人物，并将他带到了学生们的营地。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act51side/level_act51side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act51side_06","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["凛冬","乌萨斯学生A","乌萨斯学生B","众人","烈夏","“铅笔头”","费佳","叶列梅","维特","费奥多尔","激愤的学生","恐惧的学生","高大的警察","耳机里的声音","紧张的学生","“小个子”","伯塔尼","上层传来的声音","帕夫洛的声音","帕夫洛"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_soldiersstep","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"......米科拉，你在干什么？","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2177_1#1$1","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯学生A","text":"报告，有人没跟上——","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"所以你就放弃维持队伍左翼的队形？重新走一遍！","id":19},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"charslot","id":21},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_soldiersstep","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":23},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":25},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stickimp","id":27},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"0.8","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":29},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":30},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_metallicclick","channel":"3","id":31},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"0.8","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"好，拿长枪上来，顶住我的盾牌，把我逼到角落里。","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2179_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯学生B","text":"报告索尼娅，你的力气太大了，我们推不动。","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"不是你们推不动，是你们劲儿使得不够齐。","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#11$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"记住，我们不是什么散兵游勇。乌萨斯不保护我们，所以我们每个人都要当彼此的堡垒。","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"明白了吗？","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwdcheerup","id":44},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":45},{"type":"charslot","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"众人","text":"明白！","id":47},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_194_leto_1#1$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1.3","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_194_leto_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"嘿！冬将军，还在训练呢？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"刚回来吗？辛苦啦。","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"今天情况怎么样？","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_194_leto_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"好消息，昨天还摆出来耀武扬威的大炮和重武器，今天全不见了。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"尼卡那边还发现，有些人在往外搬物资，看着像是些军火。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"娜塔莉娅她们成功了，索尼娅。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"......不愧是她们。","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_194_leto_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"还有，就像之前我们聊过的那样，格罗莫夫每晚都驻扎在封锁区内的某处营地，只有巴普洛维奇才住在城墙上面。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"进攻城墙前，我们可以先消灭那些混混的主力。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"还要找到更多食物和其他补给品，有人发现他们的仓库吗？","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_194_leto_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"没有......现在的粮食还能撑多久？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"最多三天，无缚者同盟那边也快见底了，我们欠安托沙的已经太多。","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"关于食物的事，我搞砸过一次......我不能——","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_194_leto_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"快握住我的手！冬将军，不会有事的，我们一定能挺过去。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"得抓紧训练了，烈夏，我有预感，接下来的几天会决定我们的命运。","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_194_leto_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"那现在愿意上战场的人......","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"出乎意料地多，这几天的行军训练很有成效，大家都看在眼里。其他人也愿意帮助我们去做医疗和后勤工作。","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"在我们这个年纪，最不肯向不公低头了，对吗？","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_194_leto_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"哼，那也是你做得好。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"说起来，那个叫费佳的，他不是学生，也愿意参与行动吗？","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"嗯......我不知道能不能信任他。","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"直到现在，他的来历也是个谜，但他很有决心。","id":90},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"charslot","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":94},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2178_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“铅笔头”","text":"费佳！我找到了一个带肉的罐头，一起来吃点吗？","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#8$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费佳","text":"......不了，谢谢。","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2176_1#2$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶列梅","text":"别逼他了，“铅笔头”。你和费佳不熟，不知道他喜欢一个人待着吧？","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2178_1#2$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“铅笔头”","text":"都认识好几天了，哪有你说的那么生分。","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“铅笔头”","text":"对了，费佳，你看起来不像是学生，也不像是工人。","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“铅笔头”","text":"我到现在都不知道，你是怎么到了这个鬼地方的。","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#2$1","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费佳","text":"......抱歉，那是绝对不能说的。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2178_1#4$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“铅笔头”","text":"欸？","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2176_1#4$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶列梅","text":"你到底是......","id":114},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":115},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"charslot","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":119},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":122},{"type":"animtext","id":123,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>1101年12月24日</><p=2>冬季舞会开始前半个小时</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":124},{"type":"animtextclean","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":126},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$escape_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":127,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"陛下，时间不多了，我恳请您最后再考虑一下。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"考虑，是的，我的确在考虑——我在考虑，或许我们真的应该把这些脑满肠肥的老东西统统送去喂蓄肉蝎。","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"这样一来，我们不仅可以直接没收他们的家产拿到一大笔收入，还能得到一批肉质鲜美的蓄肉蝎。","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#1$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"陛下......我完全理解您的愤怒。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"可您也应该清楚，比起那些忠诚可以明码标价的产业贵族，这些资历更老的贵族是更愿意与您站在一起的。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"尤其是当您想要震慑住现在还盘踞在涅瓦湖彼岸的集团军的时候，您的确需要更多声音站在您这一边。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#2$2","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"这是他们可以与我讨价还价的资本、向我施压的底牌？","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"今年冬天连我的宫殿都快烧不起暖炉了，他们竟然还胆敢向我讨要源石去供给他们那个毫无产出的卡托加区？","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#7$2","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"他们在意的是那点微不足道的利益吗？他们只是想用这种方式来向我彰显他们的存在，试图让我低头！我岂能让他们如愿？","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"远北的女大公、集团军，还有这些旧贵族......","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#5$2","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"乌萨斯何时养出了这么多蛀虫，一个个等着舔舐血液，有一点风吹草动，他们就会造势宣扬我们的虚弱无力，对圣骏堡动手！","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#7$2","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"回答我，维特......回答说我们依然能得到这些人的尊重，即便我答应他们无理的请求，也不会被他们视作软弱。","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"并且你还能驱使那些老勋贵去战场上拼命，把第四集团军赶回他们原本的驻地——否则就别拿这件事烦我！","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#1$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"陛下......","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#4$2","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"维特，有时候我的确会想，乌萨斯的身上已经生长出了太多腐肉，就像他们力图保下的那个卡托加区，还有他们自己。","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#1$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"您说得没错，乌萨斯的确是病了。可稍有常识的医生都清楚，对于重病的病人，是不能用猛药的。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"我们的源石储备已经岌岌可危了，在我们得出具体的解决方案之前，您更需要尽一切可能阻止分裂势力继续在乌萨斯内部滋长。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#8$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"否则这些内在的矛盾，一定会先于外敌和自然环境毁灭我们。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#7$2","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"太棒了，我们伟大的乌萨斯简直就像舞会上的高卢蛋卷一样酥脆，随便谁轻轻一碰就能让她四分五裂。","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#1$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"实际上，这并不需要您做太多事。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"您只需要像往常那样安抚他们的情绪，告诉他们，乌萨斯依然需要他们的效忠，您也同样有意保护他们的利益。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"剩下的，我会代您完成。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$2","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"......你想做什么，就去做什么吧，维特。","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#2$2","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"我已经习惯了，每次我想做什么，都会被那些挂勋章的骷髅和涂脂粉的臭虫妨碍......他们不在乎乌萨斯，更不在乎我。","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#1$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"那就请您在出席舞会的时候，向他们说明这一点吧。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#4$2","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"......就不能交给你和副议长吗？我今天很累了。","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#10$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"陛下，这不合礼数。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维特","text":"您不能连续两年拒绝出席冬季舞会，何况在这个人心动荡的时候，每个臣民都盼望着您能带给大家一些信心——","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_1984_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#7$2","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"好吧好吧，我会去的，再给我一点时间！求你不要再啰嗦了，这个冬天让人心烦的事已经够多了。","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#8$2","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"下去吧维特......抱歉。","id":181},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#1$1","id":183},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#7$2","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"*极端的乌萨斯粗口*......","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"费奥多尔从房间的窗户向外望去，圣骏堡的街道完全不似往年繁华。","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$2","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"这么冷的冬天......多需要一把火啊。","id":193},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlightc","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"怎么回事......停电了？","id":197},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_riot","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":199},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激愤的学生","text":"打倒傻*乌萨斯粗口*皇帝！打倒傻*乌萨斯粗口*皇帝！打倒傻*乌萨斯粗口*皇帝！","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激愤的学生","text":"让吸血虫维特滚出来！让草包费奥多尔滚出来！","id":202},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":205},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_burn","layer":"1","id":206},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":207},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":208},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":209},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"好，如你们所愿，我在这了。","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#2$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"还真是热闹......","id":217},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"charslot","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2170_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2178_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"shake","power":"6","times":"40","duration":"0.3","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐惧的学生","text":"够了！别打了！求您放过我！","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高大的警察","text":"闭嘴！你竟敢侮辱皇帝陛下！卖国贼！","id":228},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"250,0","duration":"0.3","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"0.5","id":232},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","id":233},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dropspanner","channel":"2","volume":"0.7","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"250,0","posto":"320,-50","duration":"0.3","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":238},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stickbeat","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"150,-50","duration":"0.3","id":240},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"320,-50","posto":"300,0","duration":"0.3","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"300,0","posto":"350,-50","duration":"0.3","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"150,-50","posto":"150,-100","duration":"0.4","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":246},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stickbeat","id":247},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"350,-50","posto":"350,0","duration":"0.3","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":251},{"type":"text","text":"警棍不断地砸在那个学生背上，似乎是因为用力太猛，警棍竟甩脱了手，飞落一旁，接着砸下的是皮靴、拳头......","id":252},{"type":"dialog","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#7$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"-300,0","posto":"-300,0","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"嘿，够了，够了！他已经求饶了，你没必要下这么狠的手。","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高大的警察","text":"啊，差点把你漏了，这里还有一个卖国贼！","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"卖国？哈，我卖给你，你打算用什么价来买？","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高大的警察","text":"还敢出言不逊！我看你也是找打！","id":263},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"350,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"0.3","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":266},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","duration":"0.4","posfrom":"-300,0","posto":"-400,0","id":268},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"放肆！","id":272},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","id":274},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"250,0","duration":"0.4","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高大的警察","text":"啊——你居然敢打我！","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"没错，是我打的。骄傲吧，以后你可以向你的孩子吹嘘，你被皇帝——","id":282},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"250,0","posto":"-50,0","duration":"0.5","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":285},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"1","id":286},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"不等费奥多尔的话说完，一只沉重的拳头便已砸上了他的颧骨。","id":288},{"type":"dialog","id":289},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":290},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":291},{"type":"charslot","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":293},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"滋啦......目标......逃走......抓捕，完成！结束！","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"为了......滋啦......皇帝陛下！结束！","id":296},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":297},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tinnitus","volume":"1","id":299},{"type":"bg","duration":"2","from":"1","to":"0","block":"false","id":300},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"费奥多尔从地上爬起时，随身佩戴的隐秘通讯装置已经摔落在了地面上，他来不及检查，连忙抓起装置重新塞进耳中。","id":304},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":305,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"......","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"............","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#3$1","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"......真是要命。","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"滋啦......","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"情况不妙！有谁能听到我吗？","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"所有学生联合大会成员，马上想办法逃离，前序的车辆在往郊区方向行驶！","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"有任何能听到消息的人尽快回复我，伯塔尼结束！","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#6$1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"等等——","id":317},{"type":"dialog","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2170_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2170_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"100,0","id":320},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":321},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement_heavy1","id":322},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0.3","id":324},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":326},{"type":"text","text":"几名警察上前，不由分说地将他推进了混乱的人群，装进了狭小的载具。","id":327},{"type":"text","text":"在一片恐惧紧张的哭喊声中，载具向卡托加区驶去。","id":328},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ironchain_lock","id":330},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":331},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_doorclose","channel":"2","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"charslot","id":334},{"type":"bgeffect","id":335},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"就这样......我们所有人都被抓了起来。","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"没有解释，没有承诺，没有食物，没有帐篷。","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"我们像垃圾一样被扔进了卡托加区。","id":339},{"type":"dialog","id":340},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":341},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2186_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的学生","text":"别怕，我来帮你！","id":347},{"type":"charslot","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"稍矮的学生把费奥多尔护在身后，手里拿着一根不知何种生物的胫骨，朝围过来的牙兽不住地挥舞。","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2186_1#1$1","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的学生","text":"躲到我身后！我跟父亲去远北打过猎，我能对付这些家伙，相信我！","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的学生","text":"小心！","id":352},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stickimp","id":355},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2186_1#1$1","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的学生","text":"呼......它们跑了，好险。","id":359},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"charslot","id":361},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"5","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","id":363},{"type":"text","text":"他气喘吁吁地摔坐进雪堆里。","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#11$1","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"你的胳膊，被咬伤了。","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2186_1#1$1","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的学生","text":"啊？嘶......你身上应该不会恰好带着医用酒精和绷带吧？","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"没有。但是，等我们出去后，我会帮你寻找圣骏堡最好的医生。","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2186_1#1$1","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的学生","text":"没那个必要，这里这么冷，也不见得一定会感染。","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的学生","text":"对了，你叫什么？","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#8$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"......费奥多尔。","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2186_1#1$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的学生","text":"看在刚刚帮了你一次的分上，请容许我叫你费佳吧。你叫我“小个子”就行，同学们都这么喊我。","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"你不介意？","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2186_1#1$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“小个子”","text":"介意又改变不了什么......你要是没受伤，我就先走了。","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#2$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"等等，你是要去城墙那边？","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2186_1#1$1","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“小个子”","text":"对，我的朋友告诉我，这里管事的人很好说话，给钱就能走。","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“小个子”","text":"我凑了点钱，还不知道够不够，但至少先碰碰运气。","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“小个子”","text":"哦，给你这个，压缩饼干。如果你想找个烤火的地方，我们学生在南边有个营地。","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“小个子”","text":"再见啦，费佳——","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"......等等。","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"带上这些金币，应该足够你买通守卫了。","id":391},{"type":"charslot","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"“小个子”脸上的表情几番变化，他向费奥多尔郑重地鞠了一躬，向城墙走去。","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":395},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":396},{"type":"charslot","id":397},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“小个子”","text":"求求您了，请听我讲——！","id":399},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"playsound","key":"$knifegore","id":401},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":402},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":403},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"charslot","id":405},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#11$1","id":406},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"......","id":408},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":410},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":411},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"滋滋......伯塔尼呼叫任何人，任何人，能听见吗？","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"请给我回应......","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"“十六人议会”的暴徒们正在殴打杀害学生，我们需要帮助！","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"有没有人能听见？怎么所有频段都没人回应！","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"难道我们已经被抛弃了吗？难道我们的哭喊嘶吼都是没有声音的吗？！","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"那只是一堵墙，不是隔着一整个雪原！为什么......","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"（哭泣）为什么没人能听见我们......","id":419},{"type":"dialog","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#3$1","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"我到底应该......","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":423},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"......伯塔尼，结束。","id":425},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":426},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":428},{"type":"charslot","id":429},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":430},{"type":"dialog","id":431},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":432},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":433},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":434},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":435,"musicid":3},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":436},{"type":"dialog","id":437},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":439},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"（沙哑的低语）第三百七十三次呼叫，呼叫任何人......","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#4$1","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"......","id":444},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"我们被困在圣骏堡卡托加区内，与外界失去了联系......","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"在过去的一天内，仅仅我知道的，就有五位同学死于殴打和低温......我们身在乌萨斯光荣的首都，却挣扎在生死线上。","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"而那些杀了我的同学的凶手，此刻就坐在我上方的房间......","id":448},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#6$1","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"......！","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"第三百七十四次呼叫，呼叫，呼叫——","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"......伯塔尼，也许，你永远也没办法像远北的那个声音一样，你什么都改变不了。","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"我到底该怎么做，才能被人听到，让这一切都得到拯救？","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"（痛苦的干呕声）","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"（抽泣）","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"第三百七十四次......你已经比圣骏堡所有的高官都有毅力了。","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"或许你没有意识到，自己在做一件了不起的事。","id":459},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"......啊？","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"你能，听到我的声音？你是......","id":462},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"我......我是费佳，索尼娅营地里的人。","id":464},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"索尼娅的营地......我知道，但我过不去，不，我不敢......","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"我混进了最后一辆车，来到了这里......我原本想将看到的真相，告诉圣骏堡人：这里的年轻人，正在遭受最残酷的暴力。","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"但没有人能回应，没有人能听到......我躲藏的这个房间，还恰好是在那些暴徒的驻地的中心......","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"今天他们住进了这里，磨好的刀就插在我躲着的衣柜上......我不知道，我现在都还感觉它在抖......","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"我不敢过去跟你们会合，我会被抓住的。","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"（抽泣）我什么都做不到——","id":471},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#2$1","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"既然如此......","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"你为什么还在说话？","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"......为什么？","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"暴徒就在你的周遭，理智的人会选择缄默，会屏蔽五感，仿佛发生的一切都与自己无关......","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"就像卡托加区的事情本就与你无关......你完全可以不发声，你活在危险与痛苦中，没有人能够苛责你。","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"然而你走进了封锁区，冒着暴露的风险，在他们眼皮底下重复念着无人听闻的噩耗，你相信每一遍重复，都会给学生们带来希望。","id":480},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"我能......带来希望......同学们需要......","id":482},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#7$1","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"或者你能给出更好的解释......真是够了，一个勇敢的人喋喋不休地诉说自己的怯懦，出来一趟碰上的全是这种事。","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"你告诉我，一共有多少敌人在你那里？","id":485},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"两人。","id":487},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#2$1","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"很好，两个人是抓不住你的。你的位置能听见他们的动静吗？比如他们在说什么、状态怎样？","id":489},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"......仔细听能听见。他们一直在抱怨工作，打着哈欠，好像非常疲惫。","id":491},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#7$1","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"这就对了，疲惫的人警觉性最低。他们也是人，会虚弱，会松懈，即便是你，想杀死一个疲惫的人也轻轻松松。","id":493},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"那样还是太——","id":495},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#2$1","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"行，想不想动手随便你，那么逃跑总没问题吧？","id":497},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"今天晚上，感觉他们睡着了，听到了呼噜声，你就逃出来，不要回头。","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"如果你不认识路，我会告诉你。我从高墙一路走到了营地，对沿途的建筑都还有印象。","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"只要试试就会知道，这并不困难。","id":501},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"......我能一直听到你的声音？","id":503},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"如果这能使你有走出去的信心......","id":505},{"type":"dialog","id":506},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":507},{"type":"charslot","id":508},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":509},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_bg_bg_indoor_u.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":510},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":511},{"type":"text","text":"她想起了那一天，决定将来要去做什么的那一天。","id":512},{"type":"text","text":"尘土的气味，电子元件过热后微焦的气息......她蜷缩在座椅上，在杂乱的频率中，搜寻着自己的家乡——布列斯克的消息。","id":513},{"type":"text","text":"“接下来为您带来歌剧唱段——”","id":514},{"type":"text","text":"“嘶——”","id":515},{"type":"text","text":"手指拧动着旋钮，她需要听见故土的声音，需要这份给人带来安定的力量，来压住胸口如失重般的慌乱，哪怕只有一瞬......","id":516},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"——什么？","id":517},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_radiodisturb_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":518},{"type":"text","text":"“嘶、嘶嘶......”","id":519},{"type":"text","text":"“矿区与城市的同伴们。”","id":520},{"type":"text","text":"“我们来自远北。”","id":521},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":522},{"type":"dialog","id":523},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":524},{"type":"charslot","id":525},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":526},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":527},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":528},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":529},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":530},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4223_botany_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":531},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":532},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"......我，愿意试试。","id":533},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"我还需要确认你的身份，你不是学生吧？","id":534},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":535},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"......对，但索尼娅容许我住在这里。","id":536},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4223_botany_1#1$1","id":537},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"原来如此......我一直通过通讯给学生联合大会提供帮助，只要听到我的声音，所有学生都能认出我，知道“伯塔尼”这个代号。","id":538},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":539},{"type":"dialogue","name":"上层传来的声音","text":"帕夫洛，休息会儿吧，今天又搬了一大批物资，我都嫌累，更别说你了。","id":540},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛的声音","text":"哪里哪里，帮格罗莫夫大人分忧罢了。","id":541},{"type":"dialogue","name":"上层传来的声音","text":"好歹你爸爸给你捐了个男爵当，不至于卑微成这样吧。","id":542},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛的声音","text":"他早就去世了，我们家也......","id":543},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛的声音","text":"能不能和格罗莫夫说说，我只想尽快离开这里，我是被你们绑——","id":544},{"type":"dialogue","name":"上层传来的声音","text":"闭嘴，是我抓你过来的，那又如何？这不是老大需要一个懂算账的吗？又没亏待你。","id":545},{"type":"dialogue","name":"上层传来的声音","text":"你要真这么想出去就少说点话，待会儿继续干吧。","id":546},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4223_botany_1#3$1","id":547},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"......","id":548},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":549},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"怎么了，伯塔尼？","id":550},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4223_botany_1#3$1","id":551},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"不，没什么。","id":552},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"只是我冷静下来，听到他们的谈话......好像他们远不像我以为的那么可怕。","id":553},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":554},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"嘁，乌萨斯有多少酒囊饭袋，我是最清楚的。","id":555},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4223_botany_1#2$1","id":556},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"嘿嘿......","id":557},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"谢谢你，费佳。","id":558},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"谢谢你能听到我的声音。","id":559},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":560},{"type":"dialog","id":561},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":562},{"type":"charslot","id":563},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":564},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":565},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormlp","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":566},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":567},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":568},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":569,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2174_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":570},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":571},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":572},{"type":"text","text":"深夜，合不上的窗户时不时吹进寒风，破旧的屋子随之发出低吟。","id":573},{"type":"text","text":"帕夫洛坐在满是油渍的桌前，伴着隔壁房间的同伴如雷的鼾声，皱紧眉头翻阅着账本。","id":574},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":575},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2174_1#1$1","id":576},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"格罗莫夫申请了那么多物资，我怎么一个都没看到......","id":577},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"不对，采购价比市场价高出不少，账目上“十六勇士”的工资也远比实际的多。","id":578},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"哼，这种脏活，圣骏堡可真是不缺。","id":579},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":580},{"type":"text","text":"他轻笑一声，几乎是在同时，身后那如雷的鼾声断了一拍，变成了某种湿润的、咕噜咕噜的气泡声，就像有人在试图用水漱口。","id":581},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2174_1#1$1","id":582},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"又做梦吃肉呢？*乌萨斯粗口*蠢货，这动静像掉进汤锅里了。","id":583},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_blddpgrn","id":584},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":585},{"type":"text","text":"接着那“咕噜”声停止了，取而代之的是液体滴落在木地板上的声音。","id":586},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2174_1#1$1","id":587},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"......漏水了？","id":588},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":589},{"type":"text","text":"他揉了揉干涩的眼睛，起身走向隔壁。","id":590},{"type":"dialog","id":591},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","channel":"1","id":592},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":593},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bookdrop1","channel":"2","id":594},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","fadeout":"true","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"false","id":595},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":596},{"type":"text","text":"打开门的那一刻，帕夫洛瞳孔骤然收缩，手中的账本也落在地上——原本躺着的同伴，脖颈处正汩汩冒着黑红的液体。","id":597},{"type":"charslot","id":598},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2174_1#1$1","id":599},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"啊——","id":600},{"type":"dialog","id":601},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4223_botany_1#9$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","focus":"n","duration":"0.5","id":602},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":603},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":604},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"嘘......男爵大人，您的命在我手里。","id":605},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":606},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"你、你是谁？","id":607},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":608},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"不重要，但，我需要您的帮助。","id":609},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":610},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"......你的声音在发抖，手比声音抖得还要厉害，你很紧张吗？","id":611},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"既然如此，姑娘，放下刀，我们可以慢慢聊——","id":612},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":613},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"不......","id":614},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"如果，您喊出声，或者试图拖延时间，我就不得不杀了您。","id":615},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"就像您说的，我的手很抖，它不能保证会把刀刺向哪里。","id":616},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":617},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"别，别别......我还有妻子、父母，只要您肯放我一条生路，我什么都愿意——","id":618},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":619},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"......好，你先戴上这个耳机。","id":620},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":621},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"这是......","id":622},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":623},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"我不会一直拿刀逼着你，但如果你轻举妄动......这个耳机是第三局的最新科技成果，它随时能炸掉你的脑袋。","id":624},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":625},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"第三局？！不，我怎么会招惹到那种人——","id":626},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":627},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伯塔尼","text":"小声点......耳机那头的同学会告诉你该怎么走，你带我避开所有“十六勇士”的据点，明白了吗？","id":628},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":629},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕夫洛","text":"明白，明白......","id":630},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":631},{"type":"dialog","id":632},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":633},{"type":"charslot","id":634},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#1$1","id":635},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_bg_oldwarehouse_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":636},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":637},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":638},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":639},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"同学，告诉我你的营地，我这就过去......","id":640},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#10$1","id":641},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"呵，呵呵——","id":642},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":643},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳机里的声音","text":"......你在笑什么？","id":644},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2155_1#9$1","id":645},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费奥多尔","text":"不，没什么，先告诉我，你们附近的建筑——","id":646},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":647},{"type":"text","text":"竟然还有我的“任务”......事情越来越出乎意料了，不过似乎没有变得更糟。","id":648},{"type":"text","text":"对了，让我想想，第三局的那些疯子平时会怎么说话......","id":649},{"type":"dialog","id":650},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":651},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":652},{"type":"bgeffect","id":653},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":654},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":655},{"type":"image","id":656},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":657}],"characters":["凛冬","乌萨斯学生A","乌萨斯学生B","众人","烈夏","“铅笔头”","费佳","叶列梅","维特","费奥多尔","激愤的学生","恐惧的学生","高大的警察","耳机里的声音","紧张的学生","“小个子”","伯塔尼","上层传来的声音","帕夫洛的声音","帕夫洛"]}